          "snippet": {
            "line": 1121,
            "text": "theorem stress_lower_bound (hcone : FullTrueCone v) :\n    ∃ c : ℝ, 0 < c ∧ ∀ p : Point,\n      p.1 ∈ Ioo (NominalConeAssembly.activeLeft W) (NominalConeAssembly.activeRight W) →\n      p.2 ∈ Icc (-1 : ℝ) 1 → c * zeta v p.1 ≤ ‖stress v.profiles F.data.h p‖"
